                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "379f832a-5f85-3b91-8025-0e34dc73513c",
                        "entry_id": "d85c5dfd-4367-33b7-8a5c-bc7d2c0762bc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Temperaturerhöhung der Erdatmosphäre"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "55d09e6a-5c35-441b-bc61-5f9030b93381",
                                "sense_id": "379f832a-5f85-3b91-8025-0e34dc73513c",
                                "text": "Die Erderwärmung nimmt drastisch zu."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bd045446-c5bc-4357-b9d9-f801fbc557b5",
                                "sense_id": "379f832a-5f85-3b91-8025-0e34dc73513c",
                                "text": "„Die Klimakurve der Erderwärmung zeigt steil nach oben.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b7f506c0-ecc6-4849-bbb8-5920aa205afa",
                                "sense_id": "379f832a-5f85-3b91-8025-0e34dc73513c",
                                "text": "„Würden alle Unternehmen wie die Unternehmen des Börsenindex DAX 30 wirtschaften, würden sie eine Erderwärmung von 4,94 °C bis 2050 erzeugen.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "95993cea-364d-4c14-b3ba-cfb0d1f2743b",
                                "sense_id": "379f832a-5f85-3b91-8025-0e34dc73513c",
                                "text": "„Alle 195 Staaten haben sich dazu bekannt, die Erderwärmung nicht nur auf 2, sondern möglichst auf 1,5 Grad zu begrenzen.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "921305ac-8680-445b-afe6-a71508e1688b",
                                "sense_id": "379f832a-5f85-3b91-8025-0e34dc73513c",
                                "text": "„»2015 in Paris hat man sich darauf verständigt, die Erderwärmung auf deutlich unter 2°C zu begrenzen, wie es dort heißt.«“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e7bd9f8f-0c8b-44b0-a53a-0c020ff66fd6",
                        "source_entry_id": "d85c5dfd-4367-33b7-8a5c-bc7d2c0762bc",
                        "source_sense_id": "379f832a-5f85-3b91-8025-0e34dc73513c",
                        "source_sense_description": "Temperaturerhöhung der Erdatmosphäre",
                        "target_lang_word": "global warming",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "global warming",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3f2fb8d6-8fa8-3aea-b1cc-42c2162716e0",
                                        "entry_id": "1e8fe333-4081-3ff1-bc53-91e47afb7881",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sustained increase in the average temperature of the Earth, sufficient to cause climate change."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "30528811-816c-4c83-99b4-4353b520651c",
                                                "sense_id": "3f2fb8d6-8fa8-3aea-b1cc-42c2162716e0",
                                                "text": "As a movie, The Day After Tomorrow is your classic computer-generated cinematic confection, only the bad guy isn't an alien or a giant lizard, it's global warming."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a1e3e744-cae1-460f-a61b-bdce8835e9f8",
                                                "sense_id": "3f2fb8d6-8fa8-3aea-b1cc-42c2162716e0",
                                                "text": "In the popular imagination, global warming is mostly seen as a threat to cold-loving species, and there are good reasons for this. […] But global warming is going to have just as great an impact—indeed, according to Silman, an even greater impact—in the tropics."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "325473e8-18b8-4420-919f-88f9665b5f14",
                                                "sense_id": "3f2fb8d6-8fa8-3aea-b1cc-42c2162716e0",
                                                "text": "The study is one of the first to implicate global warming from human activities as one of the factors that played into the Syrian conflict which is estimated to have claimed more than 190,000 lives."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58b94e45-b6e6-405b-946d-c3364ebf1ffd",
                                                "sense_id": "3f2fb8d6-8fa8-3aea-b1cc-42c2162716e0",
                                                "text": "The pope’s acceptance that global warming is almost certainly man-made has irked the vocal minority with more skeptical views."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "204d0642-faf3-4447-b33c-753d239635f5",
                                                "sense_id": "3f2fb8d6-8fa8-3aea-b1cc-42c2162716e0",
                                                "text": "The Tibetan Plateau will experience significant water loss this century due to global warming, according to research published Monday that warns of severe supply stress in a climate change \"hotspot\"."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8692a051-320f-4fbd-9249-1c16388b94dc",
                        "source_entry_id": "d85c5dfd-4367-33b7-8a5c-bc7d2c0762bc",
                        "source_sense_id": "379f832a-5f85-3b91-8025-0e34dc73513c",
